MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_001: Hmph... These are poor quality, but I'll take 'em.\nLeave the jewelry and money. Here you go.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_002: Thank you, thank you! I'm so grateful to have\nsomething to feed my children!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_003: Huh? What the hell're you looking at? How long have\nyou been standing there?
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_004: <NCA>"I saw you accept that jewelry."
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_005: Huh?! You can't make me stop. I'll need the funds\nif I'm gonna become a general.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_006: <NCA>"That's a crime and you know it."
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_007: You don't know what you're talking about. I've got a\nGREAT excuse, so just shut it for a second.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_008: Since this war started, the fields've been ruined,\nthere's no one to work 'em, and people are starving.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_009: If you're in the military, you get rations. But what if\nyou can't fight or make your own way?
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_010: There are folks so hungry they're gnawing on tree\nroots. And it's just going to get worse.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_011: Tragic all around, so I'm doing what I can... Food\nis essential. Jewelry is not.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_012: You saw that woman with her shoddy baubles and a\nhandful of coins, just trying to feed her kids.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_013: <NCA>"That...actually is a great excuse."
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_014: What?! Hey, don't get me wrong. I don't have a\nshred of pity for all these people!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_015: I have my own needs, and what I need are...their\nbaubles and coins! Foolish, not to take it all.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_016: How would the starving get their food if they didn't\npony up their pittances? Plus, I look like a hero!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_017: <NCA>"OK, I can't report you after all that!"
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_018: Wait, what? Don't be an idiot! This—this is the kinda\nthing you report! You can't stay quiet.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_019: You're supposed to denounce wicked deeds—stand\nup for the righteous and the pure of heart!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_020: In light of this world crisis, I'm being greedy and\nselfish and you know it! C'mon!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_021: <NCA>"I think you're actually a good guy."
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_022: <NCB>"You've got a kind heart."
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_023: <ACA>What? Me, a "good guy"?
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_024: <ACA>Aww. Fine, maybe I am, just this once. You must\nbe rubbing off on me.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_025: <ACA>Or, wait! I'm just rubbing off on myself! I'm better\nthan anyone at being good when I want to be!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_026: <ACB>Oh, you don't need to tell ME! I'm famed the world\nover for my big heart! Notorious, even!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_027: <ACB>Though maybe you've taught me a thing or two\nabout being kind.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_028: <ACB>Or, wait! I taught me a thing or two! I was born with\na heart of gold, and everybody knows it!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_A_029: Anyway... You really should keep your opinions to\nyourself. Compliments are for chumps.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_001: You were too young, too good to go like this. Hell,\nI respected you, kid.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_002: And...you made me into a halfway decent guy.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_003: I may be late, but it's time I repent for all the bad\nstuff I did and go out and do some good, for us both.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_004: I'm still gonna try and become a general. Anyway,\ntake some food, some baubles. Rest in peace.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_005: <NCA>"Are you really going to do good?"
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_006: <NCB>"I didn't know you respected me."
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_007: Huh?! What the— You coulda killed me!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_008: Come on, I'm an old man! Have some respect,\nPromised One!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_009: Wait...is...is it really you?
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_010: Ahhh! Y-you're alive? How?!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_011: Hey! You owe me for the time I wasted on all that\nrepenting. And I want those offerings back!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_012: Eh... Sorry, I lost my temper there. And after you\ncome back from the dead and everything. Heh.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_013: <NCA>"That's very sincere of you."
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_014: Well, I really am trying to follow in your footsteps\nand be better. So I'm apologizing a lot.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_015: The old me did plenty of wrong. Back when I was a\ncenturion, I lied, cheated, thieved...
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_016: My temple dismissed me when they found out.\nI had no money, couldn't eat. Life was tough.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_017: And this eye patch? I wore it so people who knew\nabout my past wouldn't figure out who I was.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_018: <NCA>"I've always been curious."
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_019: <NCB>"And here I thought it was an injury."
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_020: <ACA>You thought it was from some terrible wound I'd\nsuffered... You would think that, wouldn't you?
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_021: <ACB>If it fooled even you, then you have to admit it was\na pretty ingenious idea.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_022: But I'm not gonna need this eye patch anymore.\nI'm choosing to accept my past.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_023: From now on, I'll live a decent life. I'll be more like\nyou, Promised One.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_024: I'm assuming your work's not done yet, right?
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_025: Well, I'm going with you. And don't try to talk me\nout of it. I've made up my mind.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_026: You'll keep making a name for yourself, and that can\nonly benefit me. I'll be a general at last.
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_027: That's right. Stick with me, and I'll be the leader of\na whole land of my own soon enough! Ahahaha!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_028: I'll be known as the bravest, mightiest general ever.\nThe name Benditz Malone will go down in history...
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_029: The more I think about this idea, the more I like it.\nWhat do you think? You on board?
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_030: <RSDS>Yeah, at last! Dreams really do come true!
MID_SE_Ism_Ven_S_031: So here's to a new start in life! The sky's the limit,\nPromised One—the absolute limit!